flowchart TD
  Interrupted[Interrupted boundary] --> State[Read revisioned session state]
  State --> Finalization{Finalization journal incomplete?}
  Finalization -->|yes| Reconcile[Classify finalization_incomplete]
  Finalization -->|no| Candidate{Registered candidate exists?}
  Candidate -->|yes| Verify[Verify path, size, SHA-256, and decode]
  Candidate -->|no| Sidecar{Rendered MP3 and recovery sidecar exist?}
  Sidecar -->|yes| RecoverCandidate[Recover manifest and technical evidence without rerender]
  Sidecar -->|no| Legacy[Classify legacy, output-missing, or failed state]
  Verify --> Review[Restore every draft in Candidate Review]
  RecoverCandidate --> Review
  Review --> Human[Require human choice before promotion]
  Reconcile --> ResumeFinal[Resume idempotent promotion without overwrite]
  ResumeFinal --> VerifyFinal[Verify final bytes, decode, journal, history, and wisdom]
  Legacy --> Preserve[Preserve artifacts and report the honest recovery state]
